{"parse":{"title":"特性/千棘鼬","pageid":7235,"revid":17267,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E5%8D%83%E6%A3%98%E9%BC%AC&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E5%8D%83%E6%A3%98%E9%BC%AC&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E5%8D%83%E6%A3%98%E9%BC%AC&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>千棘鼬</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.8D.83.E6.A3.98.E9.BC.AC\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"千棘鼬\"><b>千棘鼬</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">特性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"特性 千棘鼬.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cc/9qg91ojc6ci9irji477j2sp4fngb4bf.png/80px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E5%8D%83%E6%A3%98%E9%BC%AC.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cc/9qg91ojc6ci9irji477j2sp4fngb4bf.png/120px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E5%8D%83%E6%A3%98%E9%BC%AC.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/cc/9qg91ojc6ci9irji477j2sp4fngb4bf.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />千棘鼬\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:55%;\">\n<p>✦被非[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">正面</span>]敌人主动单体攻击时：受到伤害、穿透伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">50%</font>；且若技能不含[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"无视守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">无视守护</font></span></span>]，则进行攻击，对攻击者<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格内所有敌人造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">100%</font>的物理伤害。<br />✦造成伤害后，回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">10%</font>生命值。<br />✦受到环境伤害下降<font color=\"#ed7950\">90%</font>；受到百分比伤害下降<font color=\"#ed7950\">80%</font>；受到持续伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">50%</font>。<br />✦造成伤害后再额外回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">10%</font>生命值。<br />✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"自然守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">自然守护</font></span></span>]，效果：<br />✦最终受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">70%</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:25%;\" rowspan=\"1\"><b>该特性属于</b><br /><div class=\"hero_box\">\n<div class=\"hero_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%8D%83%E6%A3%98%E9%BC%AC\" title=\"魔物图鉴库/千棘鼬\"><img alt=\"千棘鼬 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/74/t91xmj6edu89fpndbje4nofk0t947mn.png/75px-%E5%8D%83%E6%A3%98%E9%BC%AC_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/74/t91xmj6edu89fpndbje4nofk0t947mn.png/113px-%E5%8D%83%E6%A3%98%E9%BC%AC_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/74/t91xmj6edu89fpndbje4nofk0t947mn.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164157\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.086 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 407/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9652/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3026/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   69.109      1 模板:特性\n100.00%   69.109      1 -total\n 45.16%   31.213      1 模板:中括号介绍化\n 39.27%   27.138      3 模板:中括号介绍\n 15.07%   10.414      1 模板:面包屑\n  8.73%    6.031      1 模板:魔物图\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:7235-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022164157 and revision id 17267. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"特性","missing":true}],"images":["特性_千棘鼬.png","千棘鼬_像素模型.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"<b>千棘鼬</b>","number":"1","index":"T-1","fromtitle":"模板:特性","byteoffset":null,"anchor":"千棘鼬"}],"displaytitle":"特性/千棘鼬","wikitext":"{{特性\n|魔物名称=千棘鼬\n|特性名称=千棘鼬\n|特性图标=千棘鼬\n|特性描述=✦被非[正面]敌人主动单体攻击时：受到伤害、穿透伤害降低<font color=#ed7950>50%</font>；且若技能不含[<font color=#f3c156>无视守护</font>]，则进行攻击，对攻击者<font color=#ed7950>1</font>格内所有敌人造成<font color=#ed7950>100%</font>的物理伤害。<br>✦造成伤害后，回复<font color=#58cb48>10%</font>生命值。<br>✦受到环境伤害下降<font color=#ed7950>90%</font>；受到百分比伤害下降<font color=#ed7950>80%</font>；受到持续伤害降低<font color=#ed7950>50%</font>。<br>✦造成伤害后再额外回复<font color=#58cb48>10%</font>生命值。<br>✦拥有[<font color=#f3c156>自然守护</font>]，效果：<br>✦最终受到伤害降低<font color=#ed7950>70%</font>。\n}}"},"capturedAt":"2026-10-22T16:41:57.949206+00:00"}